          "text": "According to Houston Community College System, the petitioner argued that the Fifth Circuit\u2019s decision was wrong because it ignored historical parliamentary tradition that allows elected bodies to govern their own affairs, including censuring members, and because it turned the Free Speech Clause into a \u201ccudgel and a shield.\u201d"
